<title>UK: NW Europe oil, gas rigs total 62 week ending Nov 2.</title>
<headline>NW Europe oil, gas rigs total 62 week ending Nov 2.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>The number of active oil and gas rigs in operation offshore northwest Europe totalled 62 in the week to November 27, consultants Arthur Andersen said in a report.</p>
<p>U.K. rigs were steady at 31, Norway stayed at 18 while the Dutch sector had nine. The Danish tally was four.</p>
<p>Onshore U.K. drilling was unchanged at four.</p>
<p>The report covered the period January 1 to November 27.</p>
<p>&quot;In terms of new exploration wells, the total for 1996 so far has now exceeded the total for the whole of 1995,&quot; it said.</p>
<p>-- London newsroom +44 171 542 4088</p>
